{"3428520": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Escape If You Can", "steam_appid": 3428520, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a mysterious library where endless bookshelves form a sprawling labyrinth. The air is silent, the light is dim, and scattered books suggest that something has disturbed this place long ago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to escape by solving puzzles, exploring the environment, and uncovering clues hidden among the shelves and pages. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no enemies, no combat — only your mind and the path to freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each section of the library holds its own secret: ancient mechanisms, cryptic symbols, and echoes of the past may guide you — or lead you astray. Can you uncover the truth of the labyrinth and find your way out?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a mysterious library where endless bookshelves form a sprawling labyrinth. The air is silent, the light is dim, and scattered books suggest that something has disturbed this place long ago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to escape by solving puzzles, exploring the environment, and uncovering clues hidden among the shelves and pages. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no enemies, no combat — only your mind and the path to freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each section of the library holds its own secret: ancient mechanisms, cryptic symbols, and echoes of the past may guide you — or lead you astray. Can you uncover the truth of the labyrinth and find your way out?</p>", "short_description": "Lost in a silent maze of bookshelves, you have only your wits to escape. Solve the puzzles before the labyrinth consumes you.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428520/870bc87659660527601d10653b01705f76c42975/header.jpg